data item_lot_decision: PlanItem = PlanItem {
  id: "lot-decision",
  workstream: Hardware,
  milestone: M3YearEndGate,
  rank: 20,
  min_calendar_days: 7,
  execution_mode: ExternalLead,
  exit_criterion: "EXECUTE IMMEDIATELY - the dependency is the CURRENT unit's qualification plus price/terms/sample, NOT all four S0 machines (waiting on unrelated equipment risks losing the supply): random-sample yield bound if buying, at-or-below the hedge-priced ceiling, option/ROFR attempted on the remainder - or an explicit documented pass. Depth verified at purchase time.",
  depends_on: ["hw-first-host"],
  relates_to: ["strategy.asset_lifecycle", "strategy.mt_collins_held_unit"],
  status: InProgress { note: "2026-08-30: 20 units ORDERED, and the PER-UNIT FIGURE RECORDED HERE WAS WRONG. The vendor order summary (operator, 2026-09-10) shows 35,000.00 for 20 items, which is 1,750 each, not the 1,700 this note carried - 50 per unit, 1,000 across the lot, in the direction a recalled number usually errs. FREIGHT AND TAX ARE NOW ASSESSED and that conjunct is discharged: shipping 1,650.00 plus tax 2,428.06 is 4,078.06 on top of goods, 11.7 per cent, for an order total of 39,078.06 and a DELIVERED unit cost of 1,953.90. Settled 2026-09-08 across two cards belonging to two principals - 20,000.00 personal, 19,078.06 entity - and booked in finance.personal_ledger mt_collins_owner_funded_leg for the personal leg, which is the authority for the money the MEMBER advanced; the entity's side has no carrier yet. This note is the authority for the buy decision. OUTSTANDING before Done: arrival intake sampling, and option/ROFR attempted on the remaining ~40. NOTE FOR EVERY DOWNSTREAM VIABILITY CEILING: rank on the 1,953.90 delivered figure, not the 1,750 goods figure - a ceiling compared against goods alone is wrong by 11.7 per cent" },
}

